  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Final Day",
    "summary": "As your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends, each **TYRANIDS SYNAPSE** unit of yours may pick a **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit of yours (not **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALER** or **PATRIARCH**) and a **TYRANIDS** unit of yours, both **visible** to it and within 9\". If it does:\n\n- The **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit takes D3+1 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.\n- One model in the picked **TYRANIDS** unit recovers lost wounds up to the number inflicted.\n- Until your next Movement phase starts, that **TYRANIDS** unit's models get +1 to Hit.\n\nYour **TYRANIDS** units have **Catalyst (Aura)**: friendly **GENESTEALER CULTS** units get +1 to Hit when attacking an enemy unit within 6\" of such a **TYRANIDS** unit.",
